        <h2 id="article" style="font-size:2.1em;font-family:var(--king-font,serif);font-weight:700;color:#ffe18a;margin-bottom:0.2em;">Give Us a <span style='font-family:var(--choice-font,serif);font-weight:700;color:#b91c1c;'>King</span></h2>
        <div style="font-size:1.15em;color:#ffe18a;font-weight:500;">A Voice of Truth Article (1845) — Reprinted by James White</div>
        <a href="/books/pdf/voice-of-truth/PT-AR-Part4-SP.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-gold" style="margin-top:1em;display:inline-block;">Read the Original PDF</a>
      </div>
