        <h2 style="color:#ffe18a;font-size:1.5em;font-weight:700;">The "New Organization" (1SM 204) — The Great Apostasy & The Remnant</h2>
        <p style="color:#ffe18a;font-size:1.08em;max-width:800px;">The April 15, 1904 "new organization" (1SM 204) marked the full development of the prophesied apostasy. The wise virgin Seventh-day Adventists (1841–1850) kept the faith once delivered to the saints. Those who come out of the militant 501(c)(3) church and keep the sealing Sabbath become the remnant church—the church triumphant—destined to be among the 144,000, joining those who have died in the faith in the special resurrection to see Christ coming in the clouds of heaven. <strong>Will you stand with the remnant, or follow the path of compromise?</strong></p>
